    {
      "title": "增加是默认动作，减少需要理由。",
      "body": "",
      "note": "这一页是整场提案的支点。左栏读给听众听，右侧整块留白不要填。\n\n本页目的：说清「多」的问题不在于多，而在于没人替它辩解过——每一次增加都有人签字，每一次删除都要有人承担风险。右侧那块空，就是「没人签字的东西」的位置。\n\n要避开的说法：不要讲成行业趋势或调研结论。这是我们的观察，不是数据。\n\n过渡：「既然减少需要理由，那我们的理由是什么？」\n\n【虚构概念示例。本页不含统计数字、用户访谈或市场结论。】",
      "kicker": "01 / 张力",
      "color": "#F2EFE3",
      "html": "<style>\n.p2{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;background:#F2EFE3;color:#132B1D;font-family:'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC',-apple-system,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:5vh 5.2vw 4vh}\n.p2 *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.p2 .hd{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:2vw;font-size:clamp(6.5px,.78vw,14px);letter-spacing:.16em;padding-bottom:1.6vh;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(19,43,29,.2);flex:none}\n.p2 .grid{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,42%) minmax(0,1fr)}\n.p2 .lcol{padding:2vh 3.6vw 2vh 0;border-right:1px solid rgba(19,43,29,.2);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.p2 .num{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(11px,1.7vw,29px);color:#4E6B2E;line-height:1}\n.p2 h2{margin:1.8vh 0 2.8vh;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(16px,3.3vw,56px);line-height:1.26;letter-spacing:.01em}\n.p2 p{margin:0 0 1.9vh;font-size:clamp(8px,1vw,17px);line-height:1.95;color:#3E5546;max-width:34ch}\n.p2 p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;color:#132B1D;font-family:'Songti SC',serif;font-size:clamp(9px,1.15vw,20px);line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.03em}\n.p2 .void{padding:2vh 0 2vh 3.6vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:2.6vh}\n.p2 .void .vhead{font-size:clamp(6.5px,.78vw,14px);letter-spacing:.22em;color:#93A389}\n.p2 .void .vtxt{font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(12px,1.9vw,33px);line-height:1.6;color:#A6B79B;letter-spacing:.06em;max-width:15ch}\n.p2 .vrule i{display:block;height:1px;background:rgba(19,43,29,.22);margin-bottom:1.5vh}\n.p2 .vrule i:last-child{margin-bottom:0;transform:scaleX(.42);transform-origin:left}\n.p2 hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(19,43,29,.2);margin:2.4vh 0 0;width:6vw}\n.p2 .ft{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2vw;font-size:clamp(6.5px,.78vw,14px);letter-spacing:.14em;padding-top:1.6vh;border-top:1px solid rgba(19,43,29,.2);flex:none}\n</style>\n<div class=\"p2\">\n<div class=\"hd\"><span>少一点，但好一点 · 品牌理念</span><span>02 / 06</span></div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div class=\"lcol\">\n<span class=\"num\">i.</span>\n<h2>增加是默认动作，<br>减少需要理由。</h2>\n<p>加一个功能，有人签字。砍一个功能，要有人承担风险。于是产品越来越厚，而每一样都要分走同一份注意力。</p>\n<p>让人犹豫的往往不是选不到，而是选不完。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"void\">\n<div class=\"vhead\">此 处 不 填</div>\n<div class=\"vtxt\">留着放那些还没有被删掉的东西。</div>\n<div class=\"vrule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i></div>\n<hr aria-hidden=\"true\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ft\"><span>本页描述为我们的观察，非调研结论</span><span>02 / 06</span></div>\n</div>"
